\meta{release}{Unreleased}
\meta{commit}{ec982e2}
\import{base-macros}

\p{With many agents building and testing on one host, a profiling wave ran the host out of memory and was paused. \code{\verb~|bench/slot.sh~} is the limiter that every heavy job that is not a timing goes through since: 8 slots for the host, and a class of its own with 2 slots for native-image builds. It got a memory guard within the hour (\commit{3dfe909}).}

\p{Detail: \src{bench/README.md}. Commit \commit{ec982e2}. Session: [machine speed and pipeline](ses-CVTE).}
